Each binding doubles the nesting of the previous one's type, so `f7` is 129 levels deep: past the type nesting
limit of 100.
$[Import* std]
$[# {f0 x} {' x}]
$[# {f1 x} {f0 {f0 x}}]
$[# {f2 x} {f1 {f1 x}}]
$[# {f3 x} {f2 {f2 x}}]
$[# {f4 x} {f3 {f3 x}}]
$[# {f5 x} {f4 {f4 x}}]
$[# {f6 x} {f5 {f5 x}}]
$[# {f7 x} {f6 {f6 x}}]
expect-error: limit: type nesting limit (100 levels) exceeded
